Geometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n1" value="BRIEF EXPLANATION&#10;• Layered: ParkingTicketService / PaymentService (business logic) → repositories (data access) → entities.&#10;• Customer, ParkingStaff inherit User; Customer 1 owns 1..* Vehicle; Vehicle 1 has 1..* ParkingTicket; each ParkingTicket is assigned to exactly one ParkingSlot (1-1) and has 0..1 Payment (composition).&#10;• Every repository realizes IGenericRepository&lt;T&gt;; services depend (dashed arrow) on repositories." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="470" width="400" height="175" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
